<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 12 to 15 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.8.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.8.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.7.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1215corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.8.0 (2026-11-26): Planning stage of Lineage12: four packages (one per chapter, the last also carrying the closing stories), four time-boxed iterations that match them, and the planning of the first iteration only (refinement, planning events, 14 typed tasks). Iterations 2 to 4 are planned when they start, by small steps. Dates are forecasts, never deadlines." .

ex:Lineage12 backlog:hasAuditNote "2026-11-26: the lineage status was not advanced stage by stage while the chain was built (Scope, Goal, Objective); the commits of 1.1.0 to 1.7.0 are the witness of that order. The status pointer (one value, moved in place) and the story and task states are moved in the next merged register, because a delta file only adds statements and a second value would break the single-value rules; until then the lineage pointer still reads Opened and every item reads Proposed." .

